[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1365:b007:l022","ordinal":180481,"en":"They say the road to calamitous Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1365:b007:l023","ordinal":180482,"en":"Is one from which none return;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1365:b007:l024","ordinal":180483,"en":"Even sultans entered but could not conquer"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1365:b007:l025","ordinal":180484,"en":"The grim-visaged Chinese!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1365:b007:l026","ordinal":180485,"en":"Turn Buurul's head around;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1365:b007:l027","ordinal":180486,"en":"Do not struggle, my prince—stay!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1365:b007:l028","ordinal":180487,"en":"They say assembled Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1365:b007:l029","ordinal":180488,"en":"Has never been overcome by mortal man."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1365:b007:l030","ordinal":180489,"en":"The heroes could not wreak slaughter,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l001","ordinal":180490,"en":"And the mighty could not conquer"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l002","ordinal":180491,"en":"Beijing, though it had fallen into ruin!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l003","ordinal":180492,"en":"There is a teeming Chinese people;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l004","ordinal":180493,"en":"When we ask the elders,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l005","ordinal":180494,"en":"They say it is their custom to drink the blood"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l006","ordinal":180495,"en":"Of everyone who challenges them!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l007","ordinal":180496,"en":"Many renowned khans have died"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l008","ordinal":180497,"en":"Going to confront Beijing;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l009","ordinal":180498,"en":"When we ask those who know,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l010","ordinal":180499,"en":"They say all the heroes died!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l011","ordinal":180500,"en":"Beijing is no easy land,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l012","ordinal":180501,"en":"And the Chinese are no people upon whom to take revenge."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l013","ordinal":180502,"en":"They are established as the Kakanchin,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l014","ordinal":180503,"en":"A wing of grievous calamity;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l015","ordinal":180504,"en":"It is their custom to drink the blood"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l016","ordinal":180505,"en":"Of everyone who challenges them!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l017","ordinal":180506,"en":"Their chief, Tungsha, lies there;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l018","ordinal":180507,"en":"Such is the tumult"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l019","ordinal":180508,"en":"Of great Beijing's many peoples!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l020","ordinal":180509,"en":"They answer only to themselves,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l021","ordinal":180510,"en":"They say, those imperious Chinese;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l022","ordinal":180511,"en":"Though ears have heard and eyes have seen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l023","ordinal":180512,"en":"No mortal man has conquered Beijing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l024","ordinal":180513,"en":"The people of Beijing are forty tribes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l025","ordinal":180514,"en":"Scattered in forty directions;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l026","ordinal":180515,"en":"Almighty Allah the Creator made them"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l027","ordinal":180516,"en":"To stand as a pillar"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l028","ordinal":180517,"en":"Of worldly abundance!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l029","ordinal":180518,"en":"To make war"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l030","ordinal":180519,"en":"Upon radiant Beijing—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l031","ordinal":180520,"en":"That is you consuming the good fortune"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l032","ordinal":180521,"en":"Of wretched, fierce-tempered me!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l033","ordinal":180522,"en":"To say you will conquer"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l034","ordinal":180523,"en":"Machyn, Kakan, and Bakburchun,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l035","ordinal":180524,"en":"To say you will make war"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l036","ordinal":180525,"en":"On the eminent, ancient Chinese people—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l037","ordinal":180526,"en":"That is you consuming my good fortune!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l038","ordinal":180527,"en":"Understand every word I say!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b003:l039","ordinal":180528,"en":"Do not scorn me as a woman;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l001","ordinal":180529,"en":"Lion prince, heed my words!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l002","ordinal":180530,"en":"When I asked about Beijing's nature,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l003","ordinal":180531,"en":"I learned the Creator had made it strong:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l004","ordinal":180532,"en":"It has a fortified city around it."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l005","ordinal":180533,"en":"Within every city"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l006","ordinal":180534,"en":"Of radiant Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l007","ordinal":180535,"en":"There is also a carpeted garden!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l008","ordinal":180536,"en":"The Creator distributed every kind"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l009","ordinal":180537,"en":"Of blessing throughout broad Beijing;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l010","ordinal":180538,"en":"Until the end of the age,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l011","ordinal":180539,"en":"No one shall lay a claw upon it—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l012","ordinal":180540,"en":"Almighty Allah, the one God,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l013","ordinal":180541,"en":"Created it with this promise!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l014","ordinal":180542,"en":"Great Beijing, blessed as paradise—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l015","ordinal":180543,"en":"Can a man conquer it in war?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l016","ordinal":180544,"en":"Look at its multitudes, like black worms!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l017","ordinal":180545,"en":"Esteemed Beijing, land of the Kakanchin,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l018","ordinal":180546,"en":"No mortal man has seen the whole of it;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l019","ordinal":180547,"en":"Gracious Allah created"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l020","ordinal":180548,"en":"That teeming nation!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l021","ordinal":180549,"en":"As I have heard from learned tradition,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l022","ordinal":180550,"en":"The Flood's surging waters did not reach it;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l023","ordinal":180551,"en":"Though slaughter lasted ninety years,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l024","ordinal":180552,"en":"Its sacred power did not depart!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l025","ordinal":180553,"en":"Its people were not routed and scattered;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l026","ordinal":180554,"en":"Though famine lasted ninety years,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l027","ordinal":180555,"en":"Its people's bellies did not hunger!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l028","ordinal":180556,"en":"The land you face is Beijing;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l029","ordinal":180557,"en":"My hero, my prince, heed my words."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l030","ordinal":180558,"en":"You have taken the road to a stronghold,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l031","ordinal":180559,"en":"Loading provisions on the finest tulpar!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l032","ordinal":180560,"en":"Let us grieve and suffer;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l033","ordinal":180561,"en":"Though I am a woman, stay awhile,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l034","ordinal":180562,"en":"And let us say all we have to say!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l035","ordinal":180563,"en":"My prince, if you go to Beijing, you will die;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l036","ordinal":180564,"en":"When will you see this wretched woman again?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l037","ordinal":180565,"en":"If you go to Kakan, you will die;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l038","ordinal":180566,"en":"When will you turn and come back,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1366:b004:l039","ordinal":180567,"en":"To the lady who cherishes you—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l001","ordinal":180568,"en":"When will you see your face!?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l002","ordinal":180569,"en":"If the moon is dark,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l003","ordinal":180570,"en":"Will it be night now?!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l004","ordinal":180571,"en":"Do not read while shooting,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l005","ordinal":180572,"en":"Accidentally while holding"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l006","ordinal":180573,"en":"If you don't come back,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l007","ordinal":180574,"en":"I am Aichürek bastard"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l008","ordinal":180575,"en":"The day was mine?!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l009","ordinal":180576,"en":"Not bad, not good,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l010","ordinal":180577,"en":"There is no witch without being crazy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l011","ordinal":180578,"en":"Don't start fooling around in Beijing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l012","ordinal":180579,"en":"Better than me"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l013","ordinal":180580,"en":"Beybag do not give up!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l014","ordinal":180581,"en":"Take it if you go to Beijing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l015","ordinal":180582,"en":"When visiting a certain place,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l016","ordinal":180583,"en":"I look like a bastard"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l017","ordinal":180584,"en":"Sacrifice!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l018","ordinal":180585,"en":"Widen my view,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l019","ordinal":180586,"en":"Do not make the living hell,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l020","ordinal":180587,"en":"I, the ill-fated wretch,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l021","ordinal":180588,"en":"Blue to a certain place,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l022","ordinal":180589,"en":"Put your hand up!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l023","ordinal":180590,"en":"If you accidentally pass your eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l024","ordinal":180591,"en":"Black cheek"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l025","ordinal":180592,"en":"Who can eat without food?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l026","ordinal":180593,"en":"If Kyrgyz, Argyndy"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l027","ordinal":180594,"en":"Who will start without doing kalayman!?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l028","ordinal":180595,"en":"A hawthorn tree"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l029","ordinal":180596,"en":"Who can eat without filling"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l030","ordinal":180597,"en":"Excited way, Kyrgyz"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l031","ordinal":180598,"en":"Who will start without getting tired!?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l032","ordinal":180599,"en":"If you travel for six months,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l033","ordinal":180600,"en":"A donkey's head is a brain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l034","ordinal":180601,"en":"Argyn, Kyrgyz people"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l035","ordinal":180602,"en":"Who will come and have!?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l036","ordinal":180603,"en":"Store wheat* to Kakan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l037","ordinal":180604,"en":"You've been through a lot"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l038","ordinal":180605,"en":"Argyn, Kyrgyz people"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b003:l039","ordinal":180606,"en":"You left Karan like this!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l001","ordinal":180607,"en":"You have traveled far,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l002","ordinal":180608,"en":"You will die!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l003","ordinal":180609,"en":"Aychüruk said this noise,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l004","ordinal":180610,"en":"In front of Kokjalyn"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l005","ordinal":180611,"en":"The view is walking."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l006","ordinal":180612,"en":"Blinking like tunes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l007","ordinal":180613,"en":"Laughing and talking,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l008","ordinal":180614,"en":"Okoro knotted* white chain"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l009","ordinal":180615,"en":"Walking like a game is not normal"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l010","ordinal":180616,"en":"He took it from his hand,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l011","ordinal":180617,"en":"Caught in a chain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l012","ordinal":180618,"en":"Crying out loud,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l013","ordinal":180619,"en":"Wrapped up"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l014","ordinal":180620,"en":"He was able to cry."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l015","ordinal":180621,"en":"A different kind of bastard*"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l016","ordinal":180622,"en":"From a face as white as the moon"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l017","ordinal":180623,"en":"Tears flow without touching"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l018","ordinal":180624,"en":"From a face as white as the sun"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l019","ordinal":180625,"en":"Tears flowed from dusk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l020","ordinal":180626,"en":"Sad and crying"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l021","ordinal":180627,"en":"Turned and cried,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l022","ordinal":180628,"en":"If you call Beijing, you will see it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l023","ordinal":180629,"en":"When did you come to Beibak?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l024","ordinal":180630,"en":"\"Beijing for six months"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l025","ordinal":180631,"en":"Be careful not to call it a cheap way"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l026","ordinal":180632,"en":"Chinese people are suffering"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l027","ordinal":180633,"en":"Don't be afraid of being thinner than a person!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l028","ordinal":180634,"en":"Five months in Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l029","ordinal":180635,"en":"Don't call it a close road,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l030","ordinal":180636,"en":"Careless black Chinese"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l031","ordinal":180637,"en":"Do not fear other than me!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l032","ordinal":180638,"en":"Kakanchin, your guardian"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l033","ordinal":180639,"en":"Not bad, not good,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l034","ordinal":180640,"en":"If the moon is dark,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l035","ordinal":180641,"en":"Shall we spend the night now?!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l036","ordinal":180642,"en":"When death comes and the day ends,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l037","ordinal":180643,"en":"There is no boy"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l038","ordinal":180644,"en":"Let's save the day?!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1367:b004:l039","ordinal":180645,"en":"Strict direction to Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1368:b003:l001","ordinal":180646,"en":"You want to go to bed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1368:b003:l002","ordinal":180647,"en":"Treasure without score*"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1368:b003:l003","ordinal":180648,"en":"You spread it all over the place!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1368:b003:l004","ordinal":180649,"en":"He will not go to Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1368:b003:l005","ordinal":180650,"en":"Click and start exploring!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1368:b003:l006","ordinal":180651,"en":"I needed it, bastard."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1368:b003:l007","ordi